    "detailed_description": "Engage in a unique and captivating puzzle experience as you manipulate enemies with your enchanted staff, leading them into traps to clear your path and escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807370/extras/b72e6e3cfed8d9f7d8814927b11c6adf.poster.avif?t=1747415933\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807370/extras/b72e6e3cfed8d9f7d8814927b11c6adf.webm?t=1747415933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807370/extras/b72e6e3cfed8d9f7d8814927b11c6adf.mp4?t=1747415933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807370/extras/33e15ed01972c7503a9ca76f1f721c4e.poster.avif?t=1747415933\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807370/extras/33e15ed01972c7503a9ca76f1f721c4e.apng?t=1747415933\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=100 /></picture></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Experience a constantly evolving adventure with dynamic challenges.<br>    </li><li>Find different ways to finish the levels.<br>    </li><li>Run against a stopwatch to complete each level swiftly.<br>    </li><li>Explore the levels to discover secret places to find collectables.</li></ul>",
